  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Considering only the principal values of the inverse trigonometric functions, the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msqrt><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>&#960;</mi></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is _______.</p><p>(If the numerical value has more than two decimal places, truncate/round-off the value to TWO decimal places)</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2.36",
  "solution": {
